  "pt": {
    "subject": "A decorrer agora na BidRoom: 6 leilões a não perder",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-PT\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>BidRoom</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    Uma seleção de leilões abertos — joalharia, arte, colecionáveis e mais.\n  </div>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:30px 12px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#002366;padding:28px 30px;text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                <span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\">BidRoom</span>\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px;background:#ffffff;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;color:#333;\">Olá,</p>\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#111;line-height:1.3;\">A decorrer agora</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:#333;\">Estes são alguns dos leilões abertos neste momento na BidRoom — um por categoria. Licitar é gratuito e leva menos de um minuto.</p>\n\n              <!-- Substituído no envio por 6 leilões a decorrer, um por categoria -->\n              {{AUCTIONS}}\n\n              <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background:#002366;border-radius:6px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/listings\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;\">Ver todos os leilões</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:16px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">BidRoom &middot; Portugal &middot; <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt\" style=\"color:#002366;text-decoration:underline;\">bidroom.pt</a></p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">Não pretende receber estes emails? <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/email-preferences\" style=\"color:#002366;text-decoration:underline;\">Gerir preferências</a></p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
  "en": {
    "subject": "Live now on BidRoom: 6 auctions worth a look",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n  <title>BidRoom</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;\">\n    A selection of open auctions — jewellery, art, collectibles and more.\n  </div>\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:30px 12px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#002366;padding:28px 30px;text-align:center;\">\n              <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\">\n                <span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\">BidRoom</span>\n              </a>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:30px;background:#ffffff;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;color:#333;\">Hi,</p>\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#111;line-height:1.3;\">Live right now</h1>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;color:#333;\">A few of the auctions open on BidRoom right now — one per category. Bidding is free and takes under a minute.</p>\n\n              <!-- Substituído no envio por 6 leilões a decorrer, um por categoria -->\n              {{AUCTIONS}}\n\n              <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background:#002366;border-radius:6px;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/listings\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;\">Browse all auctions</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:16px 24px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;\">BidRoom &middot; Portugal &middot; <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt\" style=\"color:#002366;text-decoration:underline;\">bidroom.pt</a></p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;\">Prefer not to receive these emails? <a href=\"https://www.bidroom.pt/email-preferences\" style=\"color:#002366;text-decoration:underline;\">Manage preferences</a></p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
  },
